{"id":"e_poque","lemma":"époque","pos":"noun","rank":706,"glosses":["epoch","time (time period)"],"ipa":"/e.pɔk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a0/Fr-%C3%A9poque.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9poque.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"époques"},"formAudio":{"époques":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9d/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-%C3%A9poques.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le savais-tu, à l'époque ?","en":"Did you know this at the time?","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Nous étions jeunes à l'époque.","en":"We were young then.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1097754","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"young","l":"jeune"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"J'étais nouvelle à cette époque.","en":"I was new at that time.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"news"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"Elle était belle à son époque.","en":"She was beautiful in her time.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"handsome","l":"beau"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null]},{"text":"C'était une autre époque.","en":"It was a different era.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"other"},null]}]}